<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S4" title="In High-Dimensional Robust Mean Estimation with Untrusted Batches" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4 </span>Technical Overview</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS1" title="In 4 Technical Overview ‣ High-Dimensional Robust Mean Estimation with Untrusted Batches" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.1 </span>Brief Review of SoS for Robust Mean Estimation</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS2" title="In 4 Technical Overview ‣ High-Dimensional Robust Mean Estimation with Untrusted Batches" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.2 </span>Leveraging Per-User Structure (Problem <span class="ltx_ref"></span>).</span></a></li>
