<div id="A4.SS4.p15" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS4.p15.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS4.p15.1.1" class="ltx_text">Considering the first part <math id="A4.SS4.p15.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\frac{1}{Nn}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\sum_{j=1}^{n}U_{i}\mathcal{I}_{i}\left(1-W_{i,j}\mathds{1}_{\left\{v_{i,j}=x_{i,j}\right\}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac><msubsup><mo rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mn>𝟙</mn><mrow><mo>{</mo><mi>v</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>}</mo></mrow></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{1}{Nn}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\sum_{j=1}^{n}U_{i}\mathcal{I}_{i}\left(1-W_{i,j}\mathds{1}_{\left\{v_{i,j}=x_{i,j}\right\}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math> of Eq. (<a href="#A4.Ex280" title="In Proof of Lemma . ‣ D.4 Identifiability ‣ Appendix D Learning From Corrupted Batches With Fractional User Data Corruption ‣ High-Dimensional Robust Mean Estimation with Untrusted Batches" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">79</span></a>), we have</span></p>
<table id="A4.EGx166" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A4.Ex287"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.Ex287.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle~\mathsf{B}\mathrel{\hbox{\raisebox{3.44444pt}{$\rule[-6.45831pt]{0.47787pt}{12.91663pt}\rule[-0.23894pt]{8.99995pt}{0.47787pt}\hskip-8.99995pt\raisebox{-6.47223pt}{\makebox[8.99995pt]{\hbox{$\scriptstyle{2}$}}}\hskip-8.99995pt\raisebox{1.96112pt}{\makebox[8.99995pt]{\hbox{$\scriptstyle{\overline{Y}}$}}}$}}}\Bigg\{\frac{1}{Nn}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\sum_{j=1}^{n}U_{i}\mathcal{I}_{i}\left(1-W_{i,j}\mathds{1}_{\left\{v_{i,j}=x_{i,j}\right\}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝖡</mi><mpadded voffset="3.4pt"><mtext class="ltx_markedasmath"><span class="ltx_rule ltx_markedasmath" style="width:0.5pt;height:12.9pt;position:relative; bottom:-6.5pt;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span></mtext><mtext class="ltx_markedasmath"><span class="ltx_rule ltx_markedasmath" style="width:9.0pt;height:0.5pt;position:relative; bottom:-0.2pt;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span></mtext><mpadded style="width:9.0pt;" voffset="-6.5pt" width="9.0pt"><mn mathsize="0.700em">2</mn></mpadded><mpadded style="width:9.0pt;" voffset="2.0pt" width="9.0pt"><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.700em">Y</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover></mpadded></mpadded><mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" stretchy="false">{</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover></mstyle><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mn>𝟙</mn><mrow><mo>{</mo><mi>v</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>}</mo></mrow></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle~\mathsf{B}\mathrel{\hbox{\raisebox{3.44444pt}{$\rule[-6.45831pt]{0.47787pt}{12.91663pt}\rule[-0.23894pt]{8.99995pt}{0.47787pt}\hskip-8.99995pt\raisebox{-6.47223pt}{\makebox[8.99995pt]{\hbox{$\scriptstyle{2}$}}}\hskip-8.99995pt\raisebox{1.96112pt}{\makebox[8.99995pt]{\hbox{$\scriptstyle{\overline{Y}}$}}}$}}}\Bigg\{\frac{1}{Nn}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\sum_{j=1}^{n}U_{i}\mathcal{I}_{i}\left(1-W_{i,j}\mathds{1}_{\left\{v_{i,j}=x_{i,j}\right\}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
